Hi <%= @budget.user.first_name %>,

<% if @threshold >= 100 -%>
You've reached your <%= @budget.name %> budget this statement month: <%= number_to_currency(@status.spent) %> of <%= number_to_currency(@status.limit) %><%= " (#{number_to_currency(-@status.remaining)} over)" if @status.remaining.negative? %>.
<% else -%>
You've used <%= number_to_percentage(@status.percent, precision: 0) %> of your <%= @budget.name %> budget this statement month: <%= number_to_currency(@status.spent) %> of <%= number_to_currency(@status.limit) %>, with <%= number_to_currency(@status.remaining) %> left.
<% end -%>

It counts <%= budget_includes(@budget).to_sentence %>. <%= budget_resets_on(@status) %>.

See your budgets: <%= budgets_url %>
